{"version":2,"text":"TEXT C\n\nThe following are indicators of high blood pressure:\n\nSevere, sudden and recurring headaches\nFrequent nose-bleeds\nVisual changes, such as blurred vision\n\nDizziness\nShortness of breath\nChest pain\nNumbness\n\nHigh blood pressure is one of the biggest risk factors for heart disease\n\nand stroke. It is a worldwide issue and is becoming increasingly\ncommon. There would be a significant reduction in the incidence of heart\n\ndisease and stroke in the UK if all patients with high blood pressure\nmade lifestyle changes and took steps to lower and control it.\n\n__________________________________________________________\n\nPage 6","layout":{"version":1,"width":612.0,"height":792.0,"blocks":[{"text":"TEXT C","lines":[{"text":"TEXT C","x":0.13764702287581698,"y":0.30250029545454543,"width":0.09493075326797389,"height":0.025454545454545452,"confidence":1,"words":[{"text":"TEXT","x":0.13764702287581698,"width":0.0695498529411765,"confidence":1},{"text":"C","x":0.21376836437908495,"width":0.01880941176470592,"confidence":1}]}]},{"text":"The following are indicators of high blood pressure:","lines":[{"text":"The following are indicators of high blood pressure:","x":0.1541176111111111,"y":0.3817184772727273,"width":0.4905670196078431,"height":0.01652727272727275,"confidence":1,"words":[{"text":"The","x":0.1541176111111111,"width":0.03656836437908495,"confidence":1},{"text":"following","x":0.19656246405228758,"width":0.09145220588235296,"confidence":1},{"text":"are","x":0.29389707679738564,"width":0.028719135620915028,"confidence":1},{"text":"indicators","x":0.3284926111111111,"width":0.09273749999999999,"confidence":1},{"text":"of","x":0.4271139705882353,"width":0.019600035947712438,"confidence":1},{"text":"high","x":0.45259191176470587,"width":0.04181981699346405,"confidence":1},{"text":"blood","x":0.5002941895424837,"width":0.05358459477124181,"confidence":1},{"text":"pressure:","x":0.559761137254902,"width":0.08492349346405223,"confidenc